/**
 * @mainpage Corporate Throne - Card Game
 *
 * @section intro_sec Introduction
 * "Corporate Throne" is a console-based card game developed in C++. In this game, players compete for the CEO's trust 
 * using various cards and strategies. The game combines elements of strategy, trading, and social interaction.
 *
 * @section features_sec Key Features
 * - Three types of cards: Characters, Actions, and Leverage cards
 * - Trading system between players
 * - Ally mechanics and their influence on gameplay
 * - Built-in AI for playing against computer
 * - Dynamic scoring system
 *
 * @section game_sec Game Rules
 * The game ends when the "CEO Death" card is drawn. The winner is the player with the highest CEO trust score. 
 * In case of a tie in trust, reputation and money scores are considered.
 *
 * @section tech_sec Technical Details
 * - Developed in C++
 * - Console interface
 * - Object-oriented architecture
 * - Comprehensive documentation using Doxygen
 *
 * @section install_sec Installation and Launch
 * To build the project, use make:
 * @code
 * make
 * @endcode
 * 
 * To launch the game:
 * @code
 * ./bin/main
 * @endcode
 * 
 * To run unit tests:
 * @code
 * make test
 * @endcode
 *
 * @section docs_sec Documentation
 * - @ref rules "Game Rules"
 * - @ref system_description "System Description"
 * - @ref testing_strategy "Testing Strategy"
 *
 * @author Platon Lukyanov (B81)
 * @version 1.0
 * @date 2025
 */ 